{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33322","headline":" · 于濆","name":"","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长闻乡人语，此家胜良贾。\n骨肉化饥魂，仓中有饱鼠。\n青春满桑柘，旦夕鸣机杼。\n秋风一夜来，累累闻砧杵。\n西邻有原宪，蓬蒿遶环堵。\n自乐固穷心，天意在何处？\n当门见堆子，已作桑田主。\n安得四海中，尽爲虞芮土。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}